  m_Name: Fish Start Presentation
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: FishingAddon::FishingAddon.FEvent
  Description: 'This event is called inside the Animator, using a animator behaviour,
    Find Invokers button will not show events inside the animator, it can only search
    for events in the scene. You can turn debug on for this, or any other event called
    by the animator, the log message will show where it''s being called.


    Fish
    Start Presentation is called inside the Fishing State, in the clip ''Fishing_End_Catch_Fish''
    using the React2Behaviour  as soon as the fisherman hand reaches the top to hold
    the fish'
